      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Fulker and Cardon (1994) proposed an interval mapping modification that allows separate estimates of QTL effect ( $ \\sigma_{A}^{2} $) and position (c) by considering two linked markers simultaneously. Recall Equation 16.36,",
