      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where the fraction $ \\widehat{\\pi}_{jt} $ of ibd QTL alleles for the jth pair is predicted using the fractions $ \\pi_{jm}^{(k)} $ of ibd alleles at each of the n marker loci on the chromosome containing the putative QTL. The $ \\beta_{k} $ are obtained from standard GLS regressions (Chapter",
