    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Here $ \\operatorname{Var}(\\pi_m^{(i)}) $ is the observed sample variance for ibd status at the ith marker (i.e., the sample variance of the $ \\pi_{jm}^{(i)} $ over all included pairs), $ c_{ik} $ is the distance between markers i and k (assumed known), and $ c_i $ is the (unknown) distance between the QTL and marker i.",
      "source_page": 535,
      "printed_page": 515,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter16:p031:b8"
      ],
      "bbox": [
